out, mais elles disent qui occupait le terrain."},"en":{"lead":"{T:home:sub} announced a 4-3-3 and attacked in a 3-2-5: a team sheet is a starting point, not a contract. On paper, {T:away:sub} lined up in a 4-2-3-1. On the pitch, in possession, it looked more like a 3-4-3.","keys":["{T:home:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-2-5 with the ball, 3-1-5-1 without.","{T:away:sub} changes shape by phase: 3-4-3 with the ball, 4-4-2 without.","{T:home:pos} favourite lane: the right wing (31% of touches).","{T:home:sub} camped in the opponent's half: 37% of touches in the final third.","{T:away:pos} favourite lane: the right wing (31% of touches)."],"impact":"{T:away:pos} plan held to the end. Average positions do not say everything, but they say who owned the space."}},"s3":{"fr":{"lead":"{T:away:Sub} a chassé plus haut et plus vite : 8,1 passes adverses par action défensive, contre 16,1.","keys":["Réaction à la perte comparable : 37 % et 30 % des ballons perdus récupérés en moins de 5 s.","16 récupérations hautes pour {T:home:sub} (ballons perdus par l'adversaire dans ses 35 derniers mètres) : autant de départs d'actions à deux pas du but.","{T:away:Sub} a contre-pressé fort : 26 % de ses pressions tombent dans les 5 s qui suivent une perte (moyenne du tournoi : 19 %)."],"impact":"Le pressing a dicté le tempo, et le résultat a suivi : quand on étouffe l'adversaire, il finit par lâcher."},"en":{"lead":"{T:away:sub} hunted higher and faster: 8.1 opponent passes per defensive action, against 16.1.","keys":["Similar reaction to losing the ball: 37% and 30% won back within 5 s.","16 high regains for {T:home:sub} (balls lost by the opponent in their own 35 metres): that many attacks starting next to goal.","Heavy counter-pressing from {T:away:sub}: 26% of pressures come within 5 s of a loss (tournament average: 19%)."],"impact":"The press set the tempo and the result followed: squeeze long enough and the opponent cracks."}},"s4":{"fr":{"lead":"D'un côté, {T:away:sub} et ses petits t